  "details": "I have an avatar with very large eyes that are pretty far apart.\n\nHowever, since your interpupillary distance (IPD) is calculated entirely based on wingspan, I can't quite match how the avatar would actually see!\n\nI'd like to be able to manually tell VRChat what IPD to use at the avatar's base scale.\n\nI'm aware that this will make the world feel smaller.",
